Subject: ASUS I007 Wi-Fi stage A: QCA6490 power and the PCIe0 link

Boot-arg asuswlan=1 (default 0: nothing): RPMh rails, WLAN_EN, GCC, PARF, QMP PHY, link,
the endpoint config space. See bsd/dev/asus_wlan.c.

